  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">You appear as a naja’zis, with prominent neck muscles, sharp, venomous fangs and possibly a flap that you can unveil to display to communicate your intent to any onlookers. Your fangs unarmed attack gains the versatile poison trait, and you gain a poison spit unarmed attack that deals 1d4 poison damage with a range increment of 20 feet, the unarmed trait, and is in the corrosive weapon group. If you later take the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.hx6KhFxwMp2Umrjr]{Serpentine Arms} feat, you can also add the option to increase the poison spit unarmed attack damage to 1d6 and increase its range increment to 30 feet.</span></p>"
